  "$comment": "Hand-written icon vocabulary. Names are Material Design Icons names (Pictogrammers, Apache-2.0) and are used verbatim as the spec `icon.name`. `pair` links an outline glyph to its filled twin, which is the ON / SELECTED state of the same thing. `role` is the semantic name the kit exposes (Icons.back etc.). build.mjs verifies every name exists in @mdi/svg and emits icons.json, paths.json, names.txt and sheet.svg.",
